55,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate A meets the demand for general space, but Candidate D solves a critical operational failure. I will vote for D.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Candidate A would be useful, but the disruption and hiring costs for replacement space are a risk. D is more essential. I vote D.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate C is too exposed to weather risks. Candidate A is a ""comfort"" project prone to delays. D is the rational choice. I vote D.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the cost of D, but B's AV gear would just be written down without a reserve again. D is the most urgent. I vote D.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,The choice is obvious. Candidate D relieves the staff and fixes the equipment. I vote D.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
